    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for managing obstacles in a terrain cell. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides functionality to apply obstacle patches, query obstacle state, and control obstacle attributes. Derived classes can implement further behavior for specific obstacle types.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="class_cell_element" kindref="compound">CellElement</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
